>**Lowers Kindred Morale**
=2 Walkthrough
* Go to {z:Castle Zvahl Keep (S)} and defeat a single {m:Shadowguard Demon}.
** You can find Shadowguard Demons on the upper floors in the room with the portals (map 3), there are one in each of the four rooms along with other demons; can pull it to the hall between the room and the portal.
** EXP will granted as soon as you kill the demon.
* Drops 3,000 Gil.
* Return to {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} and speak with {n:Rasdinice} to complete the operation and receive your {p:Allied Notes}.

=2 Game Description
\**Unit Requirement:** 1~6 members
